        {
          "text": " ahabw'okuba bashweire bamwe omuri bahara baabo, kand baabashwererera na batabani baabo; n'ahabw'ekyo eihanga eririkwera ryejwangize n'abanyamahanga b'omuri ezi nsi. Kandi abategyeki n'abakuru nibo bakirize abandi kukora ekyo kicumuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
