        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abantu boona, abu ebigambo bya Ruhanga wa Israeli byareeteire kutetema ahabw'ekicumuro ky'abaarugire omu bukwatwa, baateeranira ahu naabaire nshutami nshobeirwe, okuhitsya aha bunaku bw'okutamba ekitambo ky'omu mwabazyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
