        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka omu biro ebi ebikye MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ayorekire embabazi ze, yaagira abu yaatutsigiraho, yaatuha omwanya guhamire omu Mwanya gwe ogurikwera, ngu abone kushemuura amaihso gaitu, n'okutugaruramu otugara omu buhuuku bwaitu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
