              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu, ai Ruhanga waitu, ka waatutambiire oti, ekindi nitwenda kugamba ki? Ahabw'okuba tukareka kworobera ebiragiro byawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
